WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.242 --> 00:00:02.703
- Beautifully wrapping a
present is a way of making

00:00:02.703 --> 00:00:07.257
your last minute, bullshit
gift seem fantastic.

00:00:08.634 --> 00:00:11.128
- I grew up with my
dad owning a toy store.

00:00:11.128 --> 00:00:12.796
- Just a fat guy under the coat.

00:00:12.796 --> 00:00:14.923
- Didn't like it, boo hoo.

00:00:14.923 --> 00:00:16.007
- Let's do this.

00:00:16.007 --> 00:00:17.884
- Usually, if you're
a good enough wrapper,

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:20.220
you don't actually have to cut,
you can just kind of slide.

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.112
- You get the half crack right here.

00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:23.455
- Edges right.

00:00:23.455 --> 00:00:25.977
- These are serrated scissors,
so it's a little bit tougher.

00:00:27.978 --> 00:00:28.647
- Boom!

00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:30.447
- Beautifully wrapped present.

00:00:31.357 --> 00:00:32.357
- You're getting your kid a ball, like,

00:00:32.357 --> 00:00:33.483
why are you wrapping it?

00:00:33.483 --> 00:00:34.651
- This one's a little tougher.

00:00:34.651 --> 00:00:35.610
- This is so hard.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:37.195
- It's gettin' there, it's gettin' there.

00:00:37.195 --> 00:00:39.489
- With a ball, every side is up.

00:00:39.489 --> 00:00:40.949
- Back in the glory days, I wrapped

00:00:40.949 --> 00:00:44.370
a four foot giraffe with my dad.

00:00:46.692 --> 00:00:47.706
- You know what, this is the best

00:00:47.706 --> 00:00:48.832
it's gonna get on this side.

00:00:48.832 --> 00:00:49.591
- Spike that.

00:00:50.709 --> 00:00:52.169
- Most people get freaked out by these,

00:00:52.169 --> 00:00:53.795
but they're actually not that bad.

00:00:53.795 --> 00:00:55.130
- Doesn't need wrapping.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:56.258
- It's like an operating table.

00:00:56.258 --> 00:00:58.300
- We're gonna tuck your
head between your legs.

00:00:58.300 --> 00:01:00.094
- Kinda gotta get a little
kinky with the bear.

00:01:00.094 --> 00:01:02.429
- My mom taught me how
to just like slide the--

00:01:03.552 --> 00:01:04.411
Oh, shh...

00:01:04.411 --> 00:01:05.807
- It's a little Christmas burrito.

00:01:06.713 --> 00:01:08.226
- You might as well just
put this in a garbage bag

00:01:08.226 --> 00:01:10.061
and be like hey, got you some crap.

00:01:10.061 --> 00:01:11.521
- What kid wants a globe?

00:01:11.521 --> 00:01:12.773
- Doesn't this come in a box?

00:01:12.773 --> 00:01:13.732
- There's no South Sudan.

00:01:13.732 --> 00:01:14.691
- Oh, shit.

00:01:14.691 --> 00:01:16.067
- We're gonna make a little globe burrito.

00:01:16.067 --> 00:01:17.819
- I'd rather get coal than a globe.

00:01:21.972 --> 00:01:22.999
- You know what?

00:01:24.534 --> 00:01:26.912
- As I'm doing this, I'm
beginning to really feel like

00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:29.172
